124
00:07:09,850 --> 00:07:10,850
This moment is

125
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:12,760
I'm so happy

126
00:07:15,890 --> 00:07:19,270
Let's never be apart

127
00:07:19,770 --> 00:07:20,560
Got it

128
00:07:21,230 --> 00:07:22,110
Don't worry

129
00:07:45,050 --> 00:07:46,550
